ial for preventing abuse, reducing costs, and ensuring the stability of server resources.","concepts":["rate-limiting","reliability","databases"],"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"Introduction"},{"depth":2,"text":"Benefits of Rate Limiting"},{"depth":2,"text":"Step 1: Understanding the Problem"},{"depth":3,"text":"Key Features"},{"depth":3,"text":"Requirements"},{"depth":2,"text":"Step 2: High-Level Design"},{"depth":3,"text":"Placement Options"},{"depth":3,"text":"Guidelines for Placement"},{"depth":2,"text":"Step 3: Rate Limiting Algorithms"},{"depth":3,"text":"1. Token Bucket"},{"depth":3,"text":"2. Leaking Bucket"},{"depth":3,"text":"3. Fixed Window Counter"},{"depth":3,"text":"4. Sliding Window Log"},{"depth":3,"text":"5. Sliding Window Counter"},{"depth":2,"text":"High-Level Architecture"},{"depth":2,"text":"Advanced Considerations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Distributed Environments"},{"depth":3,"text":"Performance Optimizations"},{"depth":3,"text":"Monitoring"}],"figures":[{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/rate_limiter_architecture.png","alt":"Rate Limiting Middleware Architecture","section":"Placement Options"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/token-bucket.png","alt":"Token Bucket Algorithm","section":"1. Token Bucket"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/leaking-bucket.png","alt":"Leaking Bucket Algorithm","section":"2. Leaking Bucket"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/fixed-window-counter.png","alt":"Fixed Window Counter","section":"3. Fixed Window Counter"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/fixed-window-issue.png","alt":"Fixed Window Issue","section":"3. Fixed Window Counter"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/sliding-window-log.png","alt":"Sliding Window Log","section":"4. Sliding Window Log"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/sliding-window-counter.png","alt":"Fixed Window Counter","section":"5. Sliding Window Counter"},{"src":"/chapters/ch04-rate-limiter/images/architecture.png","alt":"Architecture"